    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Synopsis</h2>\u3000Haru Sakuragi is a girl who loves ghosts.<br><br>\u3000One day, she decides she wants to actually visit a haunted place, and decides to go to a haunted place she found on the Internet.<br>\u3000It is a junior high school that was closed down a few years ago and is said to be haunted by mysterious psychic phenomena.<br>\u3000Haru heads to the abandoned school to investigate and see if the rumors are true.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About The Game</h2>\u3000A 3D first-person horror game set in an abandoned middle school.<br><br>\u3000The game is a 3D first-person horror game set in an abandoned junior high school.<br><br>\u3000\u30fbExplore the school by collecting items and solving multiple gimmicks.<br>Collect notes left by students and investigate what happened to them.<br>\u3000\u30fbRun, hide, and sometimes fight against the oncoming enemies.<br>\u3000\u30fbPlay time: 1~2 hours<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2>\u3000Movement : W A S D key<br><br>\u3000Crouching : Ctrl key<br>\u3000Sprint : Shift key<br>\u3000Interacting : F key<br>\u3000Putting away items in hand : X key<br>\u3000Inventory : TAB key",
